Your operating-system hostname in the logs is:

```text
ca-gat-dc1-nosd-stg-vm-pectr-01
```

but RKE2 is explicitly running kubelet as:

```text
--hostname-override=master01
```

That part can be valid, but notice this log entry:

```text
Adding node master01-5b85ac7a etcd status condition
```

while the Kubernetes node appears intended to be:

```text
