  -b \
  -m shell \
  -a '/var/lib/rancher/rke2/bin/kubectl --kubeconfig /etc/rancher/rke2/rke2.yaml get nodes -o name'
```

Also check RKE2 configuration:

```bash
ansible master01 \
  -i inventory/dev/hosts.ini \
  -b \
  -m shell \
  -a 'cat /etc/rancher/rke2/config.yaml'
```

I'm particularly interested in:

```yaml
node-name:
node-ip:
token:
server:
cni:
```

For the first control-plane node I would expect approximately:

```yaml
